            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="&#x201c;Your Personal Movie Diary &#x2014; Track, Review, and Remember Every Film You Watch!&#x201d;&#xa;&#xa;Movie Log is a simple Java-based desktop app that lets you record your favorite movies, note their &#xa;details, and search them anytime.&#xa;Built using Java (JFrame) and MySQL for data storage.&#xa;&#x201c;Movie Log helps you organize your watchlist, track the movies you&#x2019;ve seen, and &#xa;rediscover your favorites  &#x2014; all in one place!&#x201d;&#xa;"/>
          </Properties>
        </Component>
